{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3ed58205-8502-8de2-a02a-0dc9eb0e4339",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T10:21:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:18:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Greg. My name is Wilson Gomes. I'm over at 177 Kay Street, up on the Hill. I'm looking to put up a fence and I wanted to find out about the permit situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:18:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. What kind of fence are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:18:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it'd be a stockade style, solid boards, you know. It runs along the side that faces the road, and that road gets a lot of traffic, so I want some privacy and a little less noise. I'm planning on composite, not wood. Five feet tall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Composite stockade, five feet, along the street side. Is it going on your property line or set back from it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Set back a little, I'd say about a foot inside. I had the lot surveyed when I bought, so I know where the line is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that helps. So generally, yes, a fence in the city needs a permit. You'd file an application with us before anything goes in the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. Now is there a height where it stops needing one? Like under four feet, or something like that? I figured maybe a short fence you don't have to bother with."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wouldn't count on that. Heights and placement both matter, and a fence facing a street gets looked at more closely for sight lines. With yours being five feet next to a busy road, plan on applying. If you want, I can have the zoning officer confirm the details for your lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:19:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And what about the fee? Do you know what it runs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee depends on the project, and it's on the fee schedule on the city website under zoning and inspections. The application page has it. I don't want to quote you a number off the top of my head and have it be wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fair. I'll look it up there. Is the application on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:20:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, same page. You can also pick up a paper copy at the counter here at City Hall. You'll want to include a sketch showing where the fence goes, the length, the height, and the material. Your survey plan would be a good thing to attach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got that. Hold on one second, Greg, I'm writing this down. I'm in the middle of a lesson plan, I tutor math on weekends, so I've got fractions all over this page and now a fence permit on the back of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:20:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Alright. Sketch, length, height, material, survey. And the fee is on the website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:20:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Once you submit, someone will review it and get back to you. Don't order materials or start digging until you've got the permit in hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:20:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. How long does the review usually take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies with how busy we are, but a simple fence is usually not a long wait. If you leave a number, the zoning officer can call you if there's anything about your lot to flag."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:21:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0151. Wilson Gomes, 177 Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:21:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you, Greg. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:21:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
